    ('work out fairly what your broken word cost them, item by item', 'W1', 'U.7', 0.5, '', {'heal': 'reflect', 'v': 'universalism, self-direction', 'act': 'work out fairly what their broken word cost them, item by item', 'chance': 0.75}),
