    ('wait and see how it goes for others before deciding anything', 'B.5 G.5', None, 0.5, '', {'v': 'security', 'sphere': 'care.BG', 'chance': 0.7}),
    ('refuse it out loud, and say your body is your own business', 'B.5 R.5', None, 0.5, '', {'v': 'self-direction', 'mark': 'defied an authority', 'sphere': 'care.BR', 'chance': 0.66}),
