    ('play it the way the old records played songs like this one', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'tradition', 'sphere': 'arts.G', 'chance': 0.75}),
    ('keep to the written part, but give it everything on the last take', 'W1', 'R.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'stimulation, conformity', 'sphere': 'arts.W', 'chance': 0.65}),
    ("learn the singer's phrasing first, and build the part around their breath", 'U1', 'G.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'benevolence, achievement', 'sphere': 'arts.U', 'chance': 0.65}),
    ('agree the fee for an extra hour before offering any new ideas', 'B1', 'W.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'security, power', 'sphere': 'arts.B', 'chance': 0.65}),
