    ('sell your skills by the day to whoever pays most, and keep your own hours', 'B.5 R.5', None, 0.5, '', {'act': 'sell their skills by the day to whoever pays most, and keep their own hours', 'v': 'self-direction, achievement', 'sphere': 'prod.BR', 'chance': 0.45}),
