    ('film the morning meetings, and post them online each evening for the town', 'U1', 'R.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'universalism, stimulation', 'lever': 'voice', 'tech': 'internet', 'sphere': 'rule.U', 'chance': 0.65}),
