    ('take the respite week, and spend it somewhere just for yourself', 'B1', None, 0.45, '', {'act': 'take the respite week, and spend it somewhere just for themselves', 'v': 'hedonism, self-direction', 'sphere': 'care.B', 'chance': 0.7}),
    ('turn the day centre down, and carry on with nerve and good humour', 'R1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'benevolence, stimulation', 'lever': 'loyalty', 'sphere': 'care.R', 'chance': 0.7}),
    ('ask the neighbours to sit with them one afternoon a week, as streets once did', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'tradition, benevolence', 'pushes': 'group neighbours', 'sphere': 'care.G', 'chance': 0.7}),
