    ('keep a page of what sold and for how much, all morning', 'W.5 U.5', None, 0.5, '', {'v': 'achievement, conformity', 'sphere': 'comm.WU', 'chance': 0.5}),
    ('stand up to the grown-up who tries to pay half the label price', 'W.5 R.5', None, 0.5, '', {'v': 'self-direction, conformity', 'lever': 'voice', 'sphere': 'comm.RW', 'chance': 0.5}),
