    ('walk away laughing, and wait to be called back', 'R1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'stimulation, hedonism', 'sphere': 'comm.R', 'chance': 0.75}),
    ('ask after his family, and leave the price to him', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'tradition, benevolence', 'sphere': 'comm.G', 'chance': 0.75}),
    ('ask the stallholders round about, openly, what such chairs fetch before making an offer', 'W1', 'U.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'universalism, conformity', 'sphere': 'comm.W', 'chance': 0.65}),
    ('judge his lowest price by how long the chair has sat, and offer just above', 'U1', 'B.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'achievement, power', 'sphere': 'comm.U', 'chance': 0.65}),
