    ('teach her son and a neighbour to walk her up the stairs each evening', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'benevolence, tradition', 'sphere': 'care.G', 'chance': 0.75}),
    ('apply by the book for a stair rail at home, so she pays nothing', 'W1', 'B.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'security, conformity', 'sphere': 'care.W', 'chance': 0.65}),
    ('work out a stair drill for her own back step, and free her from the ward', 'U1', 'R.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'self-direction, achievement', 'sphere': 'care.U', 'chance': 0.65}),
    ('call in a favour with the community team to visit her at home', 'B1', 'G.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'power, benevolence', 'sphere': 'care.B', 'chance': 0.65}),
