    ('remind yourself that you chose this life, and let no one person spoil it', 'B1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'self-direction', 'self_control': '+', 'chance': 0.9}),
    ('tell them straight out, once, that the constant corrections are too much', 'R1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'none clear (honesty of feeling)', 'chance': 0.55}),
    ('let their ways be part of the house, like the draughts and the bells', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'tradition (humility)', 'chance': 0.85}),
    ("name their faults at the community's meeting, so the head of the house corrects them", 'W1', 'U.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'conformity', 'mark': 'made an enemy', 'closed': 'approval: accusing a fellow member in front of the house; backfire: the house closes ranks around them', 'chance': 0.4}),
    ('keep a private note of every correction, in case it ever comes to a complaint', 'U1', 'B.7', 0.5, '', {'habit': True, 'v': 'power', 'closed': 'approval: keeping a file on a fellow member; backfire: the note is found and the house takes sides', 'chance': 0.85}),
    ('offer to take their turn at the pots if they leave your evenings in peace', 'B1', 'R.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'self-direction, hedonism', 'chance': 0.75}),
    ('ask them out on a walk round the fields after evening prayer, and talk', 'R1', 'G.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'benevolence', 'chance': 0.65}),
