    ('refuse to stand beside him, and say why at the campaign meeting', 'R1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'self-direction', 'chance': 0.92}),
    ('let others argue this one, and keep your strength for causes closer to home', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'security', 'chance': 0.9}),
    ('hold the campaign to its rule: every case judged on the law, not the person', 'W1', 'U.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'universalism', 'chance': 0.9}),
    ('pass a journalist the council emails you were copied into by mistake', 'U1', 'B.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'power', 'mark': 'made an enemy', 'closed': "law: using documents sent in error; backfire: a complaint, and the campaign's name in the story", 'chance': 0.45}),
    ('take the case only if you never have to share a platform with him', 'B1', 'R.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'self-direction', 'chance': 0.75}),
