    ("keep to the hour's plan, and ask the questions the scheme suggests", 'W1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'conformity', 'chance': 0.85}),
    ('ask what he would bake, if he could, and listen properly', 'U1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'benevolence, self-direction', 'chance': 0.9}),
    ('decide his case is his business, and never raise it unless he does', 'B1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'self-direction, benevolence', 'self_control': '+', 'chance': 0.95}),
    ('argue cheerfully about the lemon tart until the officer calls time', 'R1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'hedonism, stimulation', 'chance': 0.95}),
    ('let the hour wander with no plan, the way talk does between friends', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'benevolence', 'mark': 'made a friend', 'chance': 0.72}),
    ("ask the education department whether he can join the prison's cookery course", 'W1', 'B.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'achievement, benevolence', 'chance': 0.3}),
    ("order him the programme's cookbook through the prison's approved scheme", 'U1', 'R.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'hedonism, benevolence', 'chance': 0.5}),
    ('slip a slice of homemade cake past the search for him', 'B1', 'G.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'benevolence', 'mark': 'hid a wrong', 'closed': 'law: bringing items into a prison; backfire: the visits are stopped', 'chance': 0.18}),
