                     'for years reaches a person about once in a long life in uneasy times and less in secure ones '
                     "(estimate: the American 'great awakenings' came about every 40 to 80 years, local revivals and "
                     'new movements more often; insecurity, crisis and disaster raise religiosity, Bentzen 2019, '
                     'spec-5 section 3), set at 5 to 6 in 1,000 a year from 14 (about 4 in 10 lives meet one); with '
                     'the world on, the Engine fires it on a revival breakthrough when meaning needs go unmet across '
