                     'a deadly virus turned into a managed illness, a cure for a liver virus, drugs that turn some '
                     'cancers into long illnesses, gene treatments for some inherited diseases), and it reaches '
                     'someone the person knows about once or twice: about 1 to 1.5 in 100 adults and elders a year, '
                     'fewer of the young, who know fewer sick people; with the world on, the Engine fires it when '
