    ('work out which parts of the job no machine can do, and claim them', 'U1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'achievement, self-direction', 'chance': 0.6}),
    ('take the redundancy money early, and set up on your own with it', 'B1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'power, self-direction', 'mark': 'took a wild risk', 'lever': 'exit', 'pushes': 'institution employer', 'chance': 0.65}),
    ('walk out with the others and picket the gates until they talk', 'R1', None, 0.45, '', {'body': 'light', 'v': 'self-direction, benevolence', 'mark': 'defied an authority', 'lever': 'voice', 'pushes': 'institution employer', 'chance': 0.6}),
    ('move to a smaller town where the old trade is still done by hand', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'tradition, security', 'mark': 'moved away', 'moves': True, 'lever': 'exit', 'pushes': 'place', 'chance': 0.45}),
    ('jam the new machine one night, so the old way looks safer', 'B.5 R.5', None, 0.5, '', {'v': 'power, security', 'mark': 'hid a wrong', 'closed': 'law: sabotage at work; backfire: caught on the cameras, sacked and charged', 'lever': 'subvert', 'pushes': 'institution employer', 'chance': 0.55}),
